Add lib/pr-monitor/watch.js: watchLoop self-drives a ~60s jittered cadence,
runs ONE bounded runMonitorPass per tick, streams each new event as NDJSON to
stdout, applies a 2-pass flap confirm, and self-stops on pr.merged/pr.closed
(terminal event emitted last). Every effect is injectable (emit/sleep/rng/now/
gather/watcherRunning/writePid/removePid) so tests use a fake clock + fake gh.

Wire `forge shepherd watch <pr>`: extract shared buildMonitorContext from
handleEvents; handleWatch reuses it, wires SIGINT/SIGTERM to an AbortController,
and returns { started, passes, stopped } (no output — the loop streams live).

Epic c2d398e5-26cf-4963-b47a-70b4102636bb (PR-B).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
